<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela banks and markets closed Monday.</title>
<headline>Venezuela banks and markets closed Monday.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela's banks and financial markets will be closed Monday, August 18 for the Ascension of Our Lady market holiday.</p>
<p>They will reopen on Tuesday, August 19.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
